WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.637
Astronaut enters; tends and prunes green plants in a window unit.

2
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:15.761
Man tends plants in open panel; reaches deeper into machinery.

3
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:27.778
Man with glasses reaches into panel of plants and wires; works inside.

4
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:37.688
Man with glasses works on plant chambers in blue gloves.

5
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:49.807
Man continues reaching into illuminated chamber tending green plants.

6
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:00.235
Astronaut in green plants, closes chamber hatch.

7
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:12.866
"GOT A PIC AND I WANT IT" astronaut photographs a red chili pepper.

8
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:28.796
Astronauts form circle and lift joined hands upward in celebration.

9
00:01:32.723 --> 00:01:37.307
People celebrate with clapping, handshakes, and joyful movement.

10
00:01:41.321 --> 00:01:45.740
Crew members smile and stand together in a concluding group pose.
